<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Attivazione 2FA — PA SSO Proxy</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/admin/static/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="a-login-page">
  <div class="a-login-card">
    <div class="a-login-kicker">PA SSO Proxy</div>
    <h1>Attiva la verifica in due passaggi</h1>
    {% if error %}
    <div class="a-alert a-alert-danger">{{ error }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <p>La verifica in due passaggi è obbligatoria. Scansiona il QR code con un'app di autenticazione (es. FreeOTP, Aegis, Google Authenticator), poi inserisci il codice a 6 cifre generato.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;margin:16px 0;background:#fff;padding:8px;">{{ qr_svg | safe }}</div>
    <p>Oppure inserisci manualmente la chiave:</p>
    <p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:1.05em;text-align:center;word-break:break-all;">{{ secret_display }}</p>
    <form method="post" action="/admin/login/setup">
      <div class="a-form-group">
        <label class="a-label" for="code">Codice</label>
        <input type="text" id="code" name="code" class="a-input" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9 ]*" maxlength="7" autofocus required {% if banned %}disabled{% endif %}>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="a-btn a-btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;" {% if banned %}disabled{% endif %}>Attiva e accedi</button>
    </form>
    <p style="margin-top:16px;text-align:center;"><a href="/admin/login">Torna al login</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
